# Language statistics
#
# GitHub decides a repository's language by counting bytes, and this repo ships
# roughly 5 MB of third-party front-end libraries against about 13 KB of its own
# JavaScript. Left alone it reports as a JavaScript project, which misrepresents
# an ASP.NET Core codebase. Marking the vendored trees keeps them out of the
# count without removing them from the build.

Boggle/wwwroot/lib/**       linguist-vendored
Boggle/wwwroot/js/jquery/** linguist-vendored

# The word list is data, not source. Marking it generated keeps it out of the
# stats and collapses it in diffs, where 194,433 lines are never useful.
Boggle/AppData/english3.txt        linguist-generated
Boggle/wwwroot/data/english3.txt   linguist-generated
